## Why This Is Asked
This question evaluates offline-first real-time UI design skills, specifically the ability to handle correct message ordering, deduplication, and robustness to disconnects across fetch, WebSocket, and Service Worker boundaries.

## Key Concepts
- WebSocket reconnection with exponential backoff and jitter
